<div class="phead"><div class="wrap"><p class="kick">Site visits · decisions · mistakes</p><h1>Field notes</h1><p>Dated like a job log. What I saw, what changed, what it cost.</p></div></div><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards">{% for n in Target.Items %}{%- assign x=n.PublishedContent -%}<article class="card"><img src="{{ x.image.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt=""><p class="meta">{{ x.date_label }} · {{ x.location }}</p><h3 style="margin:8px 0"><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ n.RoutePath }}">{{ n.PrimaryField }}</a></h3><p>{{ x.summary }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
